                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">W</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">What it can run, the engine</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">85-90%</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Of rated capacity actually usable</p>
              </div>
